# This file is published to the wiki repository along with the pages.
#
# Without it the wiki repo falls back to core.autocrlf, so on Windows every
# page is checked out CRLF while docs/wiki holds LF. Publishing then shows all
# ~16 pages as modified when only one changed, and committing on that signal
# rewrites every file and makes the next diff unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf
